Description: Optional cloud-API AI desktop assistant for Algothix OS (ALX) Lite
 ALX Assistant is an optional Tauri + Node.js desktop assistant packaged for
 Algothix OS (ALX) Lite (Debian 13 trixie, X11/Awesome WM). It requires an
 internet connection and the user's own cloud AI API key (Gemini, Claude, or
 ChatGPT). Local LLMs are not supported on ALX Lite target hardware.
 .
 Modified from EricTechPro/jarvis (pinned commit af7465f, AGPL-3.0) with
 original ALX artwork, automatic updater removed, telemetry disabled, and safe
 defaults (allowActions=false, skipAllow=false, rawReadOnly=true).
